  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "MM Finance is a DeFi protocol with deployed contracts across chains including Polygon and Cronos, with verified contract evidence showing DEX/router, factory, liquidity/staking, token, proxy/admin, oracle, and GMX-style periphery components. Claims about additional products such as METF, Savanna, algorithmic stablecoins, launchpad functionality, or automated yield strategies should be treated as unverified unless supported by primary documentation or included in accessible audited contract scope.",
